# React Premium Template

## Usage

```bash
# 1. Copy template to new project
cp -r /home/ubuntu/.claude/templates/react-premium/ /path/to/new-project/

# 2. cd into project and install
cd /path/to/new-project
npm install

# 3. Customize for your project:
#    - package.json: name
#    - index.html: title, description, favicon
#    - tailwind.config.js: colors, fonts
#    - src/index.css: CSS variables, fonts, accent classes
#    - src/App.tsx: actual content
```

## Included UI Components (src/components/ui/)

- **TextGenerateEffect** — Character-by-character text reveal animation
- **Particles** — Canvas-based floating particle system with glow
- **SpotlightCard** — Mouse-tracking radial gradient spotlight on hover
- **MovingBorder** — Animated glowing border that orbits the card

## Responsive Skeleton (src/components/layout/Section.tsx)

**强制使用。禁止自己写固定宽度容器或硬写 px 字号。**

### 组件
- **`<Section>`** — 响应式 section 容器，自带 `clamp()` padding + 内部 1200px 最大宽度
- **`<Grid minItemWidth={280}>`** — 自适应网格，手机单列 / PC 多列自动铺

### 字号工具类（禁止用 text-5xl md:text-7xl 这种硬档位）
| 类名 | 尺寸 | 用途 |
|------|------|------|
| `fs-hero` | clamp(36→72px) | Hero 主标题 |
| `fs-display` | clamp(30→56px) | section 大标题 |
| `fs-heading` | clamp(24→40px) | h2 |
| `fs-subheading` | clamp(20→28px) | h3 |
| `fs-stat` | clamp(24→40px) | 统计数字（大数字如 ¥38,562,347 必用此类） |
| `fs-body` | clamp(15→17px) | 正文 |
| `fs-small` | clamp(13→14px) | 小字 |

### 用法示例
```tsx
import { Section, Grid } from './components/layout/Section';

<Section className="bg-zinc-900">
  <h2 className="fs-display font-bold mb-8">聚合通道，无忧收款</h2>
  <Grid minItemWidth={280}>
    <div className="glass-card p-6">
      <div className="fs-stat font-bold brand-text">¥38,562,347</div>
      <div className="fs-small">日均交易额</div>
    </div>
    {/* ... */}
  </Grid>
</Section>
```

## 部署前硬门槛（铁律）

部署完成后必须跑手机端审计：
```bash
python3 ~/.claude/tools/mobile-audit.py https://项目名.zaka.1442.com
```
退出码 1 = 不通过 = 禁止交付，必须返工。详见全局规则《手机端响应式硬门槛》。

## Must Customize Per Project

1. **Colors** in tailwind.config.js — unique palette per project
2. **Fonts** — choose distinctive Google Fonts, never Arial/Inter/Roboto
3. **CSS variables** in index.css — match tailwind colors
4. **Content** — replace App.tsx with actual sections

## Locked Dependencies

- tailwindcss: ^3.4 (NOT v4)
- framer-motion: in dependencies (NOT devDependencies)
